<title>UK: CCDQ expected to launch $250 mln four-year bond.</title>
<headline>CCDQ expected to launch $250 mln four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caisse Centrale Desjardins du Quebec will launch a $250 million four-year Eurobond shortly, dealers said on Wednesday. Merrill Lynch International and Paribas were expected to be joint lead managers, the dealers said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
